  "definition": "Computer Science Educator",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-05-10",
  "historyNote": "#12419, eff 11-14-17; renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.52); ss by #13822, eff 12-15-23, EXPIRES: 6-12-24; ss #13959, eff 5-10-24",
